    "description_raw": "You gain heightened sensitivity to the mannerisms, reactions, and body language of one creature you can perceive, allowing you to sense its state of mind and easily influence it. You gain a +10 bonus on Perception, Sense Motive, and Survival checks you attempt against the target creature, as well as a +5 bonus on Diplomacy and Intimidate checks you attempt against it.",
